 warrior is the ultimate goal  for most Giants and in line with this  worldview the leader of the giant clan  is chosen based on who is the strongest  in battle Giants live  much longer than humans and they also  have a special ability called creation  which allows them to manipulate the  earth according to droll the legendary  ancestor of the Giants a Giants power  doesn't lie only in their physical  strength rather how well they can  transform the energy of the earth  determines the true strength of a giant  Giants can use the earth to create  powerful weapons of different shapes and  sizes and then use them against their  opponents in the holy war that took  place three thousand years ago the giant  clan fought alongside the goddess Fairy  and human clans against the demon clan  despite ultimately being on the winning  side of the holy war the giant suffered  significant losses including the loss of  drol an important figure in the history  of the giant clan and the individual who  is credited with inventing the sacred  dance of the Giants we'll talk more  about role a little bit later  despite their long lifespan the  population of the Giants has dwindled  because they are often hired as  mercenaries to fight in wars between  human armies because Giants are such  powerful warriors many armies want to  hire them and sometimes both sides in a  conflict will have Giants fighting for  them which leads to Giants fighting  against other Giants and of course this  leads to more Giants being killed in  battle many humans look down on Giants  as barbarians because of their warlike  culture and in fact the culture of the  giant clan can in some ways be compared  to other warrior cultures like the  Vikings  for example the Vikings believed that  dying in battle is an honor they didn't  fear death in battle they embraced it  because they believed that those who  died fighting would be rewarded in the  afterlife and gain entry into Valhalla  which is a heavenly realm ruled by the  god Odin  similarly the Giants don't fear death in  battle and they believe that dying as a  warrior is the greatest honor the  homeland of the Giants is mega dozer a  massive hammer shaped Mountain located  more than 300 miles north of the kingdom  of Camelot the giant that we know the  most about is of course Dion or Diane or  dn  you want to pronounce it like most  members of the Giants the N is a really  strong and capable warrior and in fact  it is repeatedly stated that she has the  potential to become the strongest  warrior of the giant clan however the  ant differs from the vast majority of  the Giants because she doesn't like  fighting or bloodshed as a child she  left the giant clan because she didn't  want to live her life just to fight and  that is actually when she first met King  now the N is certainly not afraid of  battle and she is prepared to fight to  protect the people she cares about but  she thinks that fighting for the sake of  fighting is just too sad her attitude  towards fighting made her outcast among  the Giants and some of them even mocked  her because of her stance on fighting  the ants highest recorded power levels  so far has been 48,000 throughout the  series we can see the ants  struggling between her strong sense of  loyalty towards certain members of the  giant clan and especially Matrona and  her desire not to fight the warrior  culture within the giant clan is so  strong that the only purpose a giant has  in life is to become a great warrior or  if they are unable to fight well their  purpose must be to give birth to  children who will become great warriors  the N obviously doesn't want to accept  this way of life and it is through this  conflict that the ant truly develops as  a character if you'd like to see me make  a special video analyzing the N and her  development as a character let me know  down in the comments next we have  Matrona nicknamed the fang of the great  earth Matrona is the former warrior  chief of the giant clan and she was also  a mentor to d n the ants parents are  both dead and Matrona feels responsible  for turning the end into a great warrior  and she is very keen on instilling the  warrior values of the giant clan into  the end even though the N doesn't want  to fight for the sake of fighting which  of course creates a great conflict  between the two of them Matrona trained  both Dee Ann and her friend Dolores in  the fighting techniques of the Giants  and she thoroughly enjoys training and  fighting in general Matrona sees great  potential in the end  and believes that the N can become the  strongest warrior of the giant clam  after she was tricked and ambushed by  humans and shot in the leg with a  poisoned weapon Matrona was saved and  nursed back to health by a human named  Salva she developed feelings for Zappa  and began living with him and his  children's soul and Della whom she cares  for a great deal and treats as her own  children as a result of the poisonous  injury to her leg Matrona had part of  her leg amputated and now uses a wooden  leg Matrona highest recorded power level  is seven thousand six hundred then we  have Dolores  Diane's childhood friend and fellow  member of the giant clan Matrona tried  to Train Dolores to become a warrior  along with the end but just like the end  Dolores did not like fighting and  whenever she was taken into battle she  wouldn't really do anything  Diann tried to convince Dolores to leave  the giant clan with her but the Loras  refused because she felt that the Giants  would never be accepted anywhere else  outside of their own community  while the Anne was away Dolores was sent  out on a mission to fight off a bunch of  bandits and she was killed during this  mission which resulted in her being  mocked by some Giants even after her  death for being defeated by measly  bandits we also briefly met Dumbo boss  warrior chief of the Western giant clan  he faced off against Matrona dn and  Dolores during a battle because he was  hired to fight as a mercenary for a  rival army nicknamed the great trembling  Mountain he was a fierce and brave  warrior but he was ultimately killed by  Matrona in battle Matrona paid her  respects to Dumbo boss for meeting his  end as a true warrior now let's talk  about role the legendary king of the  giant clan and inventor of the sacred  dance of the Giants believed to be the  strongest giant that we have been  introduced to to date draw was always  different from the other giants because  he was taller he has blue skin and  forearms instead of two as a child this  made him an outcast within the giant  clan and when she first meets him later  on in the story  DeeAnn can relate to drawl because she  was also an outcast for much of her life  droll led the giant clan  the fight against the demons during the  holy war 3,000 years ago and he trained  other members of the giant clan to  become stronger fighters his ability to  transform the energy of the earth  surpasses any giant known today however  during the holy war drol saw that the  goddess clan was often very ruthless and  cruel destroying entire villages full of  people just because they were suspected  of helping a demon at one point drol  also came face to face with zelgius of  the ten commandments but despite his  immense strength troll was unable to  defeat zell dress because celtris was  given power directly by the demon king  and was acting as the demon Kings  representative Zell drous told troll  that the word of his legendary courage  has been spreading even among the demons  and he gave drol a choice either die  right here and now or join the 10  commandments Zell drous told rule that  the demons are outcasts just like he  always was so he should join them  impressed with the power of the ten  commandments and disillusioned with the  actions of some of the members of the  goddess clan drol chooses to join the 10  commandments trolls highest recorded  power level was a whopping 54,000 later  on in the story troll actually trains  the N and puts her to an important test  and she passes the test by making a  decision that troll would have never  made himself I will talk more about this  if I make a video on Dee and her  characters so let me know if you want to  see something like that other giants  that we see in this story include the  village elders and other inhabitants of  Megiddo sir and also some Giants who  fought alongside drol during the holy  war 3,000 years ago but these giants are  never named and that is it the giant  clan and every known giant explained  personally I am really fascinated by the  warrior culture of the giant clan  because in many ways it is similar to  the cultures of real-life warriors like  the Vikings and the samurai I also find  the conflict between this warrior  culture and the ants personality  extremely interesting and this type of  thing really is one of the greatest  strengths of the seventh of the  since the story gives us great  characters with a rich backstory and  these characters continue to develop in  really compelling ways as the story  moves forward let me know what you guys  think about the giant flan their unique  warrior culture and about the end as a  character also feel free to let me know  what types of videos you want to see  next do you want to see a video on D n  on Melly Otis on bond on the demon clan  let me know if you enjoyed this video  and want to see more be sure to leave a  like if you are new to the channel don't  forget to subscribe and hit that  notification bell we are now posting  daily anime content on Twitter and  Instagram so feel free to follow us at  anime uproar and if you want to discuss  anime recommendations theories and a  whole bunch of other stuff on a regular  basis feel free to join our discord  server link in the description as always  thank you all so much for watching and  until next time see us bass cowboys  [Music]  you  [Music]

